    "administration": "USAspending spending_by_geography, place of performance by state, fiscal year 2024, contracts A-D, grants 02-05, direct payments 06 and 10, other 09 and 11. General Services Administration, Department of the Treasury, Office of Personnel Management (awards only; federal retirement benefits are not in USAspending). Components: + General Services Administration ($25.7B); + Department of the Treasury ($7.6B); + Office of Personnel Management ($0.5B). National total $33.9B over 343,734,883 residents. Places with no recorded dollars on this line (stake 0): DE, NE, WI, MP.",
